em 2006; 14: 7160-7174.\n\nTong W, Fang H, Hong H, Xie Q, Perkins R, Anson J, Sheehan DM. Regulatory applications of SAR/QSAR for priority setting of endocrine disruptors: A perspective. Pure Appl Chem 2003; 75(11-12): 2375-2388.", "metadata": {"doc_id": "07a200c5-5d90-47bd-bc1f-29c7150f068c", "content_type": "CompositeElement", "filename": "information_requirements_r7b_en.pdf"}}